<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;The HTML looks fine to me. Many HTML elements have optional end tags. &lt;c&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/c&gt; is one of them. The following is valid HTML:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;c&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I like:
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Chocolate
  &lt;li&gt;Pizza
  &lt;li&gt;Mexican food
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yet I don't like Mexican chocolate pizza!
&lt;/c&gt;

